  "description": "YITAMotor floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F-150 SuperCab/Extended Cab\nfor 1st row W/ bench seat, 2nd row W/O Under-Seat Storage\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,ONLY for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are fit for 2015-2026 Ford F-150 SuperCab/Extended Cab (2 full size doors,2 half full size doors),Not for SuperCrew Cab, with first row Bench Seat, Not for Bucket Seat model. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back. Not for vehicles with vinyl floors\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made with odorless TPE material, ensuring safety even in extreme hot weather. The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible in even the harshest cold weather.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping. The mats are available for you.\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
